SUMMARY:Steve Flemming's Stories and Love Songs (Dinner\, Dance and Listen
 ing Party)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 I'm looking forward to sharing an evening of original music\, good convers
 ation\, and great company with all of you. Whether you're a fan of country
 \, folk\, rock\, singer-songwriter music\, or simply enjoy discovering som
 ething new music\; I hope you'll find songs that make you smile\, think\, 
 reminisce\, and maybe even get up and dance.\n\nMost of all\, I hope this 
 is an opportunity to relax\, meet some friendly people\, and enjoy an expe
 rience that's both entertaining\, uplifting and memorable.\n\n\\*Joined by
  my other groups too\; so we can anticipate a wonderful evening!\n\n**Loca
 tion:** Smoke Show - 744 Mt. Pleasant Rd.\nhttps://www.smokeshowbbqandbrew
 .com/\n**Date:** Sunday July 26th\, 2026\n**Time:** Arrive between 6:30 pm
  and 7:00 pm (if you can)\n\\*Arrive a bit early too\; if you like to get 
 settled in :)\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(S
 ongwriter and Producer)\n\nEvent Details:\n**Steve Flemming's Stories and 
 Love Songs (Dinner\, Dance and Listening Party)**\n\nCome and enjoy an eve
 ning of original music in a relaxed\, friendly atmosphere. Whether you lov
 e country\, folk\, rock\, singer-songwriter music\, or simply discovering 
 new artists\, this is a chance to hear songs you won't find anywhere else\
 ; while meeting people who appreciate great music.\n\n**What you can expec
 t:**\n\n* Listen to a variety of original songs\, from heartfelt ballads a
 nd story songs to upbeat music you'll want to sing and dance along to\n* M
 eet fellow music lovers in a welcoming\, social environment\n* Share thoug
 hts\, ask questions\, and learn about the stories and inspiration behind t
 he songs\n* Enjoy an entertaining evening filled with music\, conversation
 \, and new friendships\n\n**About Steve Flemming**\nSteve Flemming is a Ca
 nadian songwriter with a catalog of more than 1\,500 songs\, over 850 of w
 hich have been recorded. His music blends country\, folk\, roots\, rock\, 
 and singer-songwriter traditions\, ranging from thought-provoking story so
 ngs and heartfelt ballads to energetic\, feel-good songs that get people d
 ancing and singing along. Inspired by everyday life\, relationships\, spir
 ituality\, and the human experience\, Steve writes music that is both ente
 rtaining and meaningful\, creating songs that connect with listeners long 
 after the music ends.\n\n**Event Fee:**\n10 dollars (cash only) when you a
 rrive (HST is included)\nor e transfer in advance to [Steveflemming11@gmai
 l.com](http://Steveflemming11@gmail.com/)\n\n\\*If attending the 4:00 pm F
 amily Feud event that day there will be no additional entrance fee for the
  Listening Party event\n\n(One Beverage or Appetizer minimum please to sup
 port the venue and staff) (Plan to come for dinner too if you can)
